      "body": "Analysts have slightly increased their fair value estimate for Indian Bank from ₹998.08 to ₹1,001.54, reflecting somewhat higher assumed discount rates, modest adjustments to revenue growth and profit margin forecasts, and a revised future P/E of 13.94 in their updated pricing models. What's in the News Indian Bank announced an annual dividend of ₹18.25 per share, payable on July 17, 2026, with an ex date and record date of June 10, 2026 (Key Developments).",
